Source Directory for Other MIDI Support in the "midi66" Library
Chris Ahlstrom
2022-06-07 to 2026-11-17

This is the home for MIDI source code file adapted from the Seq66
and Rtl66 projects.

All such class and modules will be in the "midi" namespace.

Ultimately we expected these classes to serve as the intermediary between
the simplified Seq66 midibus classes and the Rtl66 classes refactored from
the RtMidi project.

